OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm plan rejected amid
OL,4,Avillage objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major solar farm on the
OL,7,Foutskirts of a village have been
OL,8,Frefused.
OL,10,FGrupotec Solar UK 9 Limited wanted to
OL,11,Finstall panels and battery storage
OL,12,Ffacilities on a 120 hectare site on
OL,13,FSouth Sharpley Farm in Murton, County
OL,14,FDurham.
OL,16,FFarmer and landowner Jo Hare argued the
OL,17,Fsolar farm would "protect the future"
OL,18,Fof his family's farm, but campaigners
OL,19,Fsaid it would harm the landscape.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
